# Data and derived artifacts (large; see docs/data.md for how to regenerate).
# data/results/*.csv IS tracked (see the exception below) -- those are small
# (tens of KB) reference summary files, not the raw dataset, and are kept in
# the repo as a reproducibility anchor: they are exactly what
# tests/test_paper_consistency.py checks new runs against.
/data/raw/
/data/processed/
/data/checkpoints/
/data/logs/
/data/figures/
/data/results/lists/
/data/results/per_impression_*.csv
/data/results/val_grid_*.csv

